  <p class="text-base mb-6">
    Please check my
    <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=EgGeF50AAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Google Scholar profile
    </a>
    for a full list of publications.
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-base">

    <div>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Enhancing LLM-Based Data Annotation with Error Decomposition.
        <span class="ml-2">
          [<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.11920" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">link</a>]
        </span> 
      </p>
