    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Contexts Matter but How? Course-Level Correlates of Performance and Fairness Shift in Predictive Model Transfer.
        <span class="ml-2">
          [<a href="https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/3636555.3636936" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">link</a>]
        </span>
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">†<strong>Zhen Xu</strong>, †Joseph Olson, Nicole Pochinki, Jason Zheng, Renzhe Yu.</p>
      <p class="italic leading-relaxed">The 14th Learning Analytics and Knowledge Conference, 713–724 (LAK), 2024</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

